ysics: Watch buildings crumble and explode in spectacular style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied environments: Arctic, desert, jungle, and forest—each with its own visual flair.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play it:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of arcade shooters and war-themed action games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to put down—great for short sessions or long playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually rich with stunning explosions and destruction effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro gameplay meets modern graphics and explosive fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal for players who enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military arcade games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech upgrade mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action games with destruction and explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired games with a modern twist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for air combat?</h2>Upgrade your wings, load up your bombs, and dominate the skies. In Aircraft Evolution, there are countless enemies—and even more explosions!", "short_description": "Take part in aerial battles with warplanes from different eras — from World War I to the future. Drop bombs, upgrade your aircraft, and turn enemy bases into rubble in the explosive action game Aircraft Evolution!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/5cb6efe0543e65faa7cfc8ac08567da185401075/header.jpg?t=1760137357", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/ec759eb4b7a890fcc446ddd19d9807ccfe5451fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760137357", "capsule_imagev5